\newlabel{fig:segmentation_triptych}{{23}{25}{\textbf {End-to-end segmentation triptych.} Left: raw input with complex soil background. Centre: predicted mask from RhizoAttentionNet showing clean delineation with preserved connectivity. Right: overlay demonstrating precise boundary alignment and absence of false positives}{figure.caption.27}{}}
